q("fi-013", B, 2, PAT, "A spring is 10 cm long with no load. It is 14 cm long with a 100 g load. How much did the spring stretch?", "4 cm", [W("14 cm", "wrong-calc", "14 cm is the new length. The stretch is the change."), W("10 cm", "wrong-calc", "10 cm is the first length."), W("24 cm", "wrong-calc", "Do not add. The stretch is 14 cm minus 10 cm.")], ["Stretch = new length - first length = 14 - 10 = 4 cm."], None)
